`wcr` downloads missing modem73 binaries from a **pinned** WeeChat Radio
release (`MODEM73_RELEASE` in `crates/wcr/src/modem/ensure.rs`, currently
`v0.1.79`), not from `/releases/latest`. SHA-256 pins live in
`sha256.json` next to this file. To update the pin: attach the new modem73
assets to a `wcr` GitHub release, replace the hashes in `sha256.json`, and
set `MODEM73_RELEASE` to that tag.
